# Google C++ Style Guide (format-only), tuned for this skeleton.
#
# Two deliberate departures from the stock Google preset, so the provided
# files' existing look is preserved and students' new code blends in:
#   * IndentWidth: 4     — the skeleton is written with 4-space indentation.
#   * SortIncludes: Never — keep the hand-written include order; the skeleton
#     already follows the guide's "related header first" rule manually.
#
# Style is advisory (0 marks). Run `make format` to apply, `make check` to
# verify. See the README "Style expectations" section.
#
# Generated from clang-format 14.0.6; `make check` is advisory, so minor
# version drift between clang-format 11..18 cannot break a build.
BasedOnStyle: Google
IndentWidth: 4
SortIncludes: Never
FixNamespaceComments: false
IndentPPDirectives: Leave
ColumnLimit: 100
